e set upon by a group of mysterious Beheeyem, only to be rescued by a kindly Nuzleaf who offers them shelter in the peaceful community of Serene Village. There they meet a well-meaning but overeager partner, an outsider like themselves who dreams of joining the famous Expedition Society, a band of Pok\u00e9mon explorers who investigate mysteries across the land. Together the two are drawn into a growing crisis: Pok\u00e9mon everywhere, even mighty legendary ones, are being turned to stone by an unknown malevolent force. Inducted into the Expedition Society, the player and partner venture into ever-shifting dungeons, battling foes and unraveling clues in search of the truth behind the petrifications, the player's lost human past, and the darkness threatening their world.", "summary": "Pok\u00e9mon Super Mystery Dungeon is a roguelike video game in the Pok\u00e9mon Mystery Dungeon series. Like its predecessors, players control a human who has awoken as a Pok\u00e9mon in a world filled entirely by the series' eponymous creatures, and must travel through random-generated dungeons completing missions and battling enemies to unravel the story.", "themes": [{"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pokemon-super-mystery-dungeon--1", "videos": [{"id": 4342, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "NQNNXJky5CE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NQNNXJky5CE", "title": "\u3010\u516c\u5f0f\u3011\u300e\u30dd\u30b1\u30e2\u30f3\u8d85\u4e0d\u601d\u8b70\u306e\u30c0\u30f3\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3\u300f\u521d\u516c\u958b\u6620\u50cf", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NQNNXJky5CE/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 472, "name": "Pok\u00e9mon Mystery Dungeon"}]}